sequenceDiagram
    participant SIEM
    participant Triage as Triage Engine
    participant DP as Data Principal<br/>Notification (CM.AW-P7)
    participant Board as Board Notification<br/>(DPDPA-specific)
    participant Audit as Audit Log<br/>(CT.DM-P8)

    SIEM->>Triage: Security event detected
    Triage->>Triage: Classify as personal data breach<br/>(Section 2(u) criteria)
    Triage->>DP: Tier 1: Notify affected Data Principals<br/>"without delay" (Rule 7(1))
    Triage->>Board: Tier 2a: Initial intimation to Board<br/>"without delay" (Rule 7(2)(a))
    Triage->>Audit: Log breach event + all actions
    Note over Board: Clock: 72 h from awareness<br/>(extendable on written request)
    Triage->>Board: Tier 2b: Detailed report within 72 h<br/>(Rule 7(2)(b)(i)-(vi))
    Audit->>Audit: Retain all records >= 1 year<br/>(Rule 6(1)(e))
